    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 possible fruits and one goal, reach the Watermelon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is to combine matching fruits to evolve them to the next one and eventually reach the coveted Watermelon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To help you, you have 3 different abilities at your disposal. But watch out, using these will cost you some of your points. Be smart about when you use them to get the highest score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLAYER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Measure your fruit skills against another player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GET THE WATERMELON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How many Watermelons can you combine before your basket overflows?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >USE YOUR ABILITIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power, level up and destroy \u2014 These abilities will help you reach the Watermelon, using any of those will also allow you to angle your aim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GOLDEN FRUIT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If luck is on your side, you might even see the mysterious Golden Fruit. Find it and witness its effect firsthand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STATISTICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your progress with in-depth statistics. Visit the menu to see the number of fruits you've combined, your ability usage, and much more. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 possible fruits and one goal, reach the Watermelon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is to combine matching fruits to evolve them to the next one and eventually reach the coveted Watermelon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To help you, you have 3 different abilities at your disposal. But watch out, using these will cost you some of your points. Be smart about when you use them to get the highest score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLAYER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Measure your fruit skills against another player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GET THE WATERMELON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How many Watermelons can you combine before your basket overflows?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >USE YOUR ABILITIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power, level up and destroy \u2014 These abilities will help you reach the Watermelon, using any of those will also allow you to angle your aim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GOLDEN FRUIT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If luck is on your side, you might even see the mysterious Golden Fruit. Find it and witness its effect firsthand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STATISTICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your progress with in-depth statistics. Visit the menu to see the number of fruits you've combined, your ability usage, and much more. </p>",
    "short_description": "A Casual Physics Puzzle game, where you have to combine matching Fruits to get Points and increase your Highscore. Play solo or measure your skills against another player online.",
